{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:59:22+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:59:22+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Talgo, S.A.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","country":"Spain","city":"Madrid","website":"https://www.talgo.com","employees":3622,"summary":"Talgo, S.A. engages in design, manufacture, and maintenance of railway and auxiliary machinery for the maintenance of railway systems rolling stock worldwide. It provides high speed, intercity, commuter and regional, and locomotive railway products. The company is also involved in the manufacture, delivery, and maintenance of commercialized rolling stock, auxiliary and other, machines, such as pit lathes, measuring equipment, and shunting cars, as well as rolling stock renovations/remodelling. The company was formerly known as Pegaso Rail International, S.A. Talgo, S.A. was founded in 1942 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Talgo, S.A. s’occupe de la conception, de la fabrication et de l’entretien de machines ferroviaires et auxiliaires pour l’entretien du matériel roulant des systèmes ferroviaires dans le monde entier. Il fournit des produits ferroviaires à grande vitesse, interurbains, régionaux et régionaux, ainsi que des locomotives. La société est également impliquée dans la fabrication, la livraison et la maintenance de matériel roulant commercial, auxiliaire et autres, de machines, telles que les tours à fosse, les équipements de mesure et les voitures de manœuvre, ainsi que dans la rénovation et le remodelage du matériel roulant."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":317745824,"shares_outstanding":134069969,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":13.542857,"price_to_book":1.6133424,"ev_to_ebitda":127.94,"ev_to_revenue":1.112,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":0.982},"targets":{"current_price":2.37,